# CDM Shared Types

- No I/O, no side effects, no external dependencies
- Pure types, constants, and lightweight derived data (e.g. `Object.values(...)`, lookup maps)
- Enum-like objects: `as const` + derived type pattern (same idea as repo-wide `.cursor/rules/typed-string-constants.mdc`)

```typescript
export const EXAMPLE = { FOO: 'foo', BAR: 'bar' } as const;
export type Example = (typeof EXAMPLE)[keyof typeof EXAMPLE];
```

- Every new API contract type (request/response shapes, error codes) belongs here
- Rebuild after changes: `npm run build:cdm`
